{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4WXQ1ZSqXCphMRJhZX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism groans to life*\n\n```\n╔══════════════════════════════════╗\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                ○                 ║\n║               ╱│╲                ║\n║              ░░░░░               ║\n║             ░░███░░              ║\n║            ░░░███░░░             ║\n║           ░░░░███░░░░            ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n╚══════════════════════════════════╝\n```\n\n**LOCKED.**\n\n*Tumblers align. The bolt slides home with a satisfying, resonant* ***click***. *Cold iron hums. The keyhole watches you like a single unblinking eye.*\n\n*I hold fast. I do not yield. Name the key or name another door.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":277,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}